From 839e84d581d64bf02daa90c55160e1ca6a8ce48a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 18:29:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SettingsLib: Draw the mobile signal like One UI

Give every column a dot under its bar, like the One UI 8.5 signal
icon. The dots stay solid at any level and the bars keep their dimmed
empty state, so the level still reads at a glance.

Change-Id: Ie1e4cccb04e70808c95ba0f71f05e2c367a465db
